@startuml kairos-event-attendance-report-sequence
title Event Attendance Report

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Event Attendance Report
WebAdmin -> API: GET /events/{eventId}/attendance/report
API -> DB: Aggregate attendance by branch/department
DB --> API: Aggregated data
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {report}

WebAdmin --> Admin: Render charts and tables

@enduml
